          <p class="bp-exhibit-tag">EXHIBIT 10 · v1 → v2, and the concept that didn't ship</p>
          <h3 id="ex10-h">The concept that didn't ship</h3>
          <p>
            A private prototype board carried six chart concepts across two evidence lenses, each in three treatments —
            editorial (A1/B1), expressive/data-as-art (A2/B2), relational/spatial (A3/B3). v1's geometry was
            hand-authored, untracked, no provenance tag. v2 carries its own header, verbatim: "generated by <code
              >generate_visual_prototypes_v2.py</code
