        <h2 id="coda-h" class="bp-movement-title">The part that outlives</h2>
        <p>
          The deliverable was never the offer. It's the archive, a briefing for whoever owns the building next, and a
          disclosure pipeline built so it structurally cannot leak what 543 rows of respondents said. The 23 August
